{"content":"It seems there was an issue with the tool call format. Let's correct it and proceed with the calculation.\n\nThe formula to calculate the percentage of TDRs associated with commercial loans in 2012 is:\n\\[ \\text{Percentage} = \\left( \\frac{\\text{TDRs associated with commercial loans}}{\\text{Total TDRs}} \\right) \\times 100 \\]\n\nUsing the values from the numeric catalog:\n- TDRs associated with commercial loans in 2012: $541 million (source: t2c1n0)\n- Total TDRs in 2012: $2859 million (source: t3c1n0)\n\nLet's calculate this using the correct format for the `calculate` tool.\n```json\n{\n  \"message\": \"Calculating the percentage of TDRs associated with commercial loans in 2012.\",\n  \"tool\": \"calculate\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"expression\": \"(541 / 2859) * 100\",\n    \"variables\": {\n      \"541\": {\"value\": 541, \"source\": \"source:t2c1n0\", \"unit\": \"million\"},\n      \"2859\": {\"value\": 2859, \"source\": \"source:t3c1n0\", \"unit\": \"million\"}\n    },\n    \"sources\": {\n      \"541\": \"source:t2c1n0\",\n      \"2859\": \"source:t3c1n0\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```","elapsed_seconds":10.42936571710743,"finish_reason":"stop","generated_token_count":343,"generated_token_ids":[2132,4977,1052,572,458,4265,448,279,5392,1618,3561,13,6771,594,4396,432,323,10354,448,279,21937,382,785,14806,311,11047,279,11414,315,350,7687,82,5815,448,8353,16606,304,220,17,15,16,17,374,510,78045,1124,1318,90,36167,92,284,1124,2359,7,1124,37018,35702,1318,76025,7687,82,5815,448,8353,16606,3417,35702,1318,90,7595,350,7687,82,3417,1124,1291,8,1124,15136,220,16,15,15,1124,2533,16429,279,2750,504,279,24064,16403,510,12,350,7687,82,5815,448,8353,16606,304,220,17,15,16,17,25,400,20,19,16,3526,320,2427,25,259,17,66,16,77,15,340,12,10657,350,7687,82,304,220,17,15,16,17,25,400,17,23,20,24,3526,320,2427,25,259,18,66,16,77,15,692,10061,594,11047,419,1667,279,4396,3561,369,279,1565,35597,63,5392,624,73594,2236,198,515,220,330,1994,788,330,57908,1095,279,11414,315,3